-- Query: eb_summary_long_period_model_type (DR4 names)
-- Serves: Question C. Number of long-period eclipsing binaries per model type. ELLIPSOIDAL models have no eclipse.
-- Names: the draft DR4 data model of 26 Jun 2026. The schema name gaiadr4 is taken from that model's own example
--   query.
-- DR3 stand-in: dr3/eb_summary_long_period_model_type.adql, made from this file by make_standin.py. DR3 tables:
--   gaiadr3.vari_eclipsing_binary.
-- Last ran without error on the DR3 stand-in: 2026-10-27 (6 rows; results/run_log.tsv).
-- Last ran on DR4: never. The archive has no DR4 until 2 Dec 2026.
-- DR4 columns this query relies on:
--   gaiadr4.vari_eclipsing_binary: frequency, model_type
-- Lines tagged DR4ONLY have no DR3 equivalent and are dropped from the stand-in.
-- Cannot be tested before release: The DR4 model types and their counts.
SELECT
    eb.model_type,
    COUNT(*) AS n_sources
FROM gaiadr4.vari_eclipsing_binary AS eb
WHERE eb.frequency < 0.01
GROUP BY eb.model_type
ORDER BY eb.model_type
